{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"fca4f5edf3db0235dc8fd044faff79e778de84fec921b7fb10d000adc83f5c32","digest":{"component_or_area":"live DC harness / store-copy fixture","key_entities":[".bridge_state","tests/external/live_jira_dc/_dc_fixtures.py","tests/external/live_jira_dc/test_store_copy_isolation.py","rebar._store.project_ensures.seed_projects_mapping_unit","dc_store_copy_repo fixture","run_ensures()","tests/unit/test_dc_store_copy_fetch_diagnostics.py","commit 72731d3745",".bridge_state/projects.json"],"problem_keywords":["store-copy scrub","bridge_state artifact","regression","ensure unit","git archive"],"propositions":["The live DC harness test test_store_copy_isolation.py::test_the_store_copy_is_complete_and_scrubbed fails because .bridge_state artifact survives the store-copy scrub","The scrub removes .bridge_state* and commits; then run_ensures() converges the store and the projects-seed ensure unit unconditionally re-creates .bridge_state/projects.json, resurrecting the removed artifact","The projects-seed ensure unit was added after the scrub logic was written, causing a pure ordering regression where a new ensure unit re-introduces artifacts after the one-shot scrub","The fix is to extract scrub_bridge_state() helper and re-run it with commit=True after run_ensures() to remove the resurrected .bridge_state/* from both worktree and tickets tree"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787718050074033001,"uuid":"22a5e4aa-ff30-42eb-a0a5-5c1e57d46252"}